<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 class="v2-h2">What do people ask about <em>Bronze Essentials?</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-faq">
      <details><summary>What&rsquo;s included in Bronze Essentials?</summary><p>Professional packing of all rooms, a fully insured removal to your new home, furniture reassembly at destination, light cleaning of the vacated property, and a dedicated move coordinator.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Who is Bronze Essentials ideal for?</summary><p>Clients who mainly need the physical move handled, typically once you know where you&rsquo;re heading, without paying for services you don&rsquo;t need.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does Bronze Essentials include a dedicated coordinator?</summary><p>Yes. Every Bronze Essentials move includes a dedicated move coordinator.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you pack fragile items like china or artwork?</summary><p>Yes. Fragile and sentimental items are packed with appropriate protective materials as standard, with no extra charge for careful handling.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I haven&rsquo;t found my new home yet?</summary><p>Bronze Essentials assumes your destination is already confirmed. If you&rsquo;re still searching, a Discovery Consultation is the better starting point.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I need more support than Bronze offers?</summary><p>If your move also involves staging or legal coordination, Silver Comfort or Gold Prestige may be a better fit, whether or not you&rsquo;ve already found your home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is it fully insured?</summary><p>Yes. All removals carried out by Chayce are fully insured.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much is Bronze Essentials?</summary><p>Bronze Essentials starts at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}. The final price depends on the size of the property and the support you need, and is confirmed in writing before you book.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does Bronze Essentials include unpacking?</summary><p>No. Bronze Essentials covers packing, a fully insured removal, furniture reassembly and light cleaning of the vacated property. Unpacking and set-up at the new home start with <a href="/silver-comfort/">Silver Comfort</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does Bronze Essentials include a deep clean?</summary><p>Bronze Essentials includes light cleaning of the vacated property. A deep clean of the vacated home comes with Silver Comfort.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I need a Discovery Consultation before booking Bronze Essentials?</summary><p>No. If you already know where you are moving and mainly need packing and removals, you can go straight to Bronze Essentials. If your plans are still open, a <a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation</a> (&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }}) is the better starting point.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is Bronze Essentials only for older people?</summary><p>Our services are designed with older people in mind, but anyone who wants a fully managed move is welcome.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I arrange Bronze Essentials for a parent who lives far away?</summary><p>Yes. Moves are often arranged by adult children on a parent&rsquo;s behalf. You can be involved by phone or video, and your coordinator keeps you updated throughout.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you work outside Northampton?</summary><p>Yes. We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the whole UK.</p></details>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

